sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant UI as Web Portal
    participant API as RetailersController
    participant Service as RetailerService
    participant Store as RetailerStore
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant Email as Transactional Email Service

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. VIEW PENDING RETAILER REGISTRATIONS
    %% ==========================================

    Admin->>+UI: Open Retailer Registration Review

    UI->>+API: List(status = Pending)
    API->>+Service: ListAsync(filters)

    Service->>+Store: Retrieve pending Retailers
    Store->>+DB: SELECT pending Retailer records
    DB-->>Store: Pending Retailer list
    deactivate DB

    Store-->>Service: Retailer records
    deactivate Store

    Service-->>API: Pending Retailer list
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: 200 OK - Retailer list
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Admin: Display pending registrations
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. VIEW REGISTRATION AND ASSESSMENT
    %% ==========================================

    Admin->>+UI: Select Retailer for review

    UI->>+API: Get(retailerId)
    API->>+Service: GetAsync(retailerId)

    Service->>+Store: FindViewAsync(retailerId)
    Store->>+DB: SELECT Retailer, assessment, contact and MLOR
    DB-->>Store: Retailer details
    deactivate DB

    Store-->>Service: Registration information
    deactivate Store

    Service-->>API: Retailer details
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: 200 OK - Registration details
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Admin: Display declaration and assessment
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% 3. REVIEW RETAILER REGISTRATION
    %% ==========================================

    Admin->>+UI: Submit approval or rejection decision

    Note over Admin,UI: Approval includes official potential class,<br/>priority, Sales Group and payment term

    UI->>+API: Review(retailerId, decision, reviewData)

    alt Administrator is authorized

        API->>+Service: ReviewAsync(retailerId, decision, reviewData)

        Service->>+Store: FindForUpdateAsync(retailerId)
        Store->>+DB: SELECT Retailer and current status for update
        DB-->>Store: Retailer record and current status
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Retailer review data
        deactivate Store

        alt Approve valid pending Retailer

            Service->>+Store: Approve registration and provision account

            Store->>+DB: TRANSACTION - Assign 8-digit code,<br/>activate Retailer, finalize assessment and MLOR,<br/>create or link account and Sales assignment

            DB-->>Store: Approval committed
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Active Retailer and business code
            deactivate Store

            Service->>+Email: SendRetailerAccountCreatedAsync()
            Email-->>Service: Email delivery result
            deactivate Email

        else Reject pending Retailer

            Note over Admin,Service: Rejection requires a reason

            Service->>+Store: Reject registration with reason

            Store->>+DB: UPDATE Retailer status and rejection reason
            DB-->>Store: Rejection committed
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Rejected Retailer
            deactivate Store

        else Invalid or previously processed registration

            Note right of Service: Reject invalid transition,<br/>missing reason or conflicting decision

        end

        Service-->>API: Review result or business error
        deactivate Service

    else User is not authorized

        Note right of API: Reject review request

    end

    API-->>UI: Approval, rejection or error response
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Admin: Display final review result
    deactivate UI